  infil crawlspace - vented 1,            !- Name
  {117dacb5-994b-4b1d-9f96-c391b875e8aa}, !- Space or SpaceType Name
  {df5d2b45-0b0d-466c-9356-9be6ef449d3c}, !- Schedule Name
